# ── Generated weight / data blobs ───────────────────────────────
# These are regenerated locally by the extraction scripts in this repo.
# Weights are large and must never be committed. The small frozen oracles
# below (each <= 96 KiB) are tracked instead.
data/*.bin
# Inputs + expected outputs: what compare_*.py diff against.
!data/*_input_T*.bin
!data/*_expected_*.bin
!data/input.bin
!data/expected_y.bin
# June 2026 worker responses: regression oracles (live runs must cmp-identical).
!data/*_response_*.bin
data/live/
data/MNIST/

# ── Compiled binaries ───────────────────────────────────────────
orchestrator
worker
*.o
*.out
a.out

# ── Protobuf generated code ─────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated per-machine via `make proto` — never share across machines
# (different protobuf versions produce incompatible generated code).
hydra.pb.h
hydra.pb.cc

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ── Editor / OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# ── Logs / scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
worker.log
worker_out.log

# Private working notes
CLAUDE.md
reports/
floatSum
.claude/
*nano*
